msgid "Satellite view is unavailable: genuine captures for this saved world are missing or invalid. The normal map remains visible."
msgstr "卫星视图不可用：缺少此存档的真实截图，或截图未通过验证。普通地图仍然可见。"

msgid "Development prototype: displays verified static captures on the global map. Native dynamic lighting and unloaded buildings are still under development."
msgstr "开发原型：在世界地图上显示经过验证的静态截图。原生动态光照和未加载建筑仍在开发中。"

msgid "Global map"
msgstr "世界地图"

msgid "Satellite view"
msgstr "卫星视图"

msgid "Optional global-map layer. Requires genuine captures for this saved world; the minimap keeps its existing map source."
msgstr "可选的世界地图图层。需要此存档的真实截图；小地图继续使用原有地图来源。"

msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "诊断"

msgid "Detailed log"
msgstr "详细日志"

msgid "Write detailed diagnostics to RE_Kenshi_log.txt. Errors are always logged."
msgstr "将详细诊断信息写入 RE_Kenshi_log.txt。错误始终会被记录。"
